      "text": "ECONOMIC:\n    Trade liberalization (WTO, NAFTA/USMCA, EU single market)\n    Global finance: currency flows, derivatives, sovereign debt\n    Production chains: global value chains (GVC) → Apple designed in US;\n                       components from 40 countries; assembled in China\n    Labor arbitrage: production migrates to low-wage countries"
    },
