      "text": "CULTURAL:\n    Media flows: Hollywood, K-pop, telenovelas → unequal circulation\n    \"Cultural imperialism\" thesis (Schiller): American cultural dominance\n    Counter: \"Glocalization\" (Robertson): global products adapted locally\n             (McDonalds menu in India ≠ McDonalds in US)\n    Cultural hybridity (Bhabha, Appadurai): new forms from mixture"
    },
