      "text": "DIGITAL:\n    Network society (Castells): flows of information restructure power\n    Platform economies: Facebook, Amazon, Alibaba — transnational private power\n    Surveillance capitalism (Zuboff): behavioral data as commodity\n    Digital divides: differential access by country, class, gender"
