      "text": "THEORETICAL FRAMEWORKS:\n  World-systems theory (Wallerstein): structural economic hierarchy\n  Global cities (Sassen): spatial command centers of global capital\n  Migration sociology: transnationalism; diaspora; push-pull\n  Network society (Castells): space of flows vs. space of places\n```"
