      "text": "THREE ZONES:\n  CORE:\n    Processes high value-added production + financial services\n    Capital-intensive, high technology, high wages\n    Strong states: can enforce advantageous exchange terms\n    Historical: Western Europe → US → now contested\n    Extract surplus from periphery through unequal exchange"
    },
